 "Bopomofo for children in Brazil: where to start at home": 1,
 "Bopomofo or pinyin: which first?": 1,
 "It depends on where the child is headed. For ties to Taiwan or materials from there, bopomofo first. For mainland China, pinyin is the standard. Many children learn both later on.": 1,
